tippani\">पृष्ठे</span> ।</span></div></details></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline tpn-blk\" data-side=\"tippani\" data-label=\"गोविन्दप्रसादिनी\"><details class=\"tpn-run\"><summary class=\"tpn-bar\" title=\"गोविन्दप्रसादिनी — 1 note; click to open or fold\">टिप्पणी · 1</summary><div class=\"tpn-lab\">गोविन्दप्रसादिनी</div><div class=\"tpn-n\" id=\"tpn-Kathaka-1.3.3-70-1\"><a class=\"tpn-num\" href=\"#Kathaka:1.3.3:b24\" data-tpb=\"Kathaka:1.3.3:b24\" title=\"back to the word\">भा 1</a><span class=\"tpn-ka\" title=\"Kailash Ashram edition: page · note\">KA <span class=\"tpn-kn\">70·1</span></span> <span class=\"tpn-x\"><b class=\"tpn-prat\"><span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\"><span class=\"bhsj\">रथबद्धहयेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">रथ-बद्ध-हय इति</span></span></b>—<span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\">अत्र</span> <span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\"><span class=\"bhsj\">रथवद्धयेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">रथ-वत्-हय इति</span></span> <span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\"><span class=\"bhsj\">टीकानुरोधी</span><span class=\"bhsp\">टीका-अनुरोधी</span></span> <span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\">पाठः</span> ।</span></div></details></div>","<div class=\"tpn-sblk\" data-side=\"tippani\" data-label=\"गोविन्दप्रसादिनी\"><details class=\"tpn-run\"><summary class=\"tpn-bar\" title=\"गोविन्दप्रसादिनी — 1 note; click to open or fold\">टिप्पणी · 1</summary><div class=\"tpn-lab\">गोविन्दप्रसादिनी</div><div class=\"tpn-n\" data-tpid=\"tpn-Kathaka-1.3.3-70-1\"><a class=\"tpn-num\" href=\"#Kathaka:1.3.3:b24\" data-tpb=\"Kathaka:1.3.3:b24\" title=\"back to the word\">भा 1</a><span class=\"tpn-ka\" title=\"Kailash Ashram edition: page · note\">KA <span class=\"tpn-kn\">70·1</span></span> <span class=\"tpn-x\"><b class=\"tpn-prat\"><span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\"><span class=\"bhsj\">रथबद्धहयेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">रथ-बद्ध-हय इति</span></span></b>—<span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tippani\">अत्र</span> <span class=\"w tpn-w\" data-g=\"tip